    "scope": "Three actually inspected exterior pictures and standard viewer PMTiles/DEM only. No bespoke surveys or redistributed photographs.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saigon_Notre-Dame_Basilica.jpg",
        "author": "Ngô Trung",
        "date": "2011-11-03",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Inspected enlarged front exterior: paired red brick square towers with cream corner/cornice bands,round-headed paired windows and upper louvres,tall pale grey square spires with triangular dormer faces and crosses. Central brick stepped gable has small white clock,large circular rose in arched surround,three ground entrance axes and small paired upper windows. Image has a sepia/pink cast;natural color uses matching side/rear pictures. Foreground statue,plants,people and cars excluded."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saigon_Notre-Dame_Basilica_Side.JPG",
        "author": "Ottre",
        "date": "2008-04-06",
        "license": "public-domain",
        "observed": "Inspected enlarged front/side exterior: natural red brick walls with pale stone bands;dark red tile nave and lower aisle roofs;long paired round clerestory/aisle windows;projecting transept has a high triangular tile gable and large circular rose. Tower belfry faces have paired arched light-colored louvres;metal square spires have triangular dormer fronts. Trees and street furniture partly occlude the base;hidden joins estimated."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Saigon_Notre-Dame_Basilica_from_Lê_Duẩn_St.jpg",
        "author": "TomW712",
        "date": "2014-03-17",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Inspected enlarged rear/side exterior: elevated polygonal main choir with red hipped tile roof,round-headed tall upper lights and lower small circular fields;three lower polygonal apsidal chapel projections with radial tile roofs and pale corner pilasters. Transept shows large rose and lower paired lights. Nave/choir cornices carry a simple pale arcade;roof ridge fencing and fine ironwork abstracted or omitted by LOD. Temporary banners,trees,cars,people and surrounding town excluded."
      }
    ]
  }
